TURBO/64 BBS v__VERSION__
A modern C64 BBS written in C
for the Oscar64 compiler.
Native .prg output for real HW
and C64 Ultimate. Now ships
dual builds: REL disk image
or SoftIEC folder storage.
Supports PETSCII, ANSI/CP437,
ASCII. Msg boards, door
programs + dev kit, users,
and a SysOp config editor.
